  "description": "TOJNOW crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group I a -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C24 H48 K1 O6 1+,C68 H114 O9 Sm6 1-. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1B (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1Y (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1A (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1X (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm1Z (Sm) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.565-5.074 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.27-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C91.5H160.5I0.5KO14.5Sm6.",
